==English==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|en|ang|þurh}} {{m|ang|ūt}}, equivalent to {{com|en|through|out}}

===Pronunciation===
* {{enPR|thro͞o-out'}}, {{IPA|[θɹuːˈʷaʊt]|lang=en}}
* {{a|Canada}} {{IPA|/θɹuˈʌʊt/|lang=en}}
* {{audio|en-us-throughout.ogg|Audio (US)|lang=en}}
* {{rhymes|aʊt|lang=en}}

